#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Cyrus SASL"
msgstr "Instalação do Cyrus SASL"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not support parallel build."
msgstr "Esse pacote não suporta construção paralela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix the package to be compatible with gcc-15:"
msgstr "Primeiro, corrija o pacote para ser compatível com gcc-15:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../cyrus-sasl-2.1.28-gcc15_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fiv</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../cyrus-sasl-2.1.28-gcc15_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fiv</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid "Also, fix a problem revealed by gcc-14 and later:"
msgstr "Também, corrija um problema revelado pelo gcc-14 e posteriores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:130
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed '/saslint/a #include &lt;time.h&gt;'       -i lib/saslutil.c &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/plugin_common/a #include &lt;time.h&gt;' -i plugins/cram.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed '/saslint/a #include &lt;time.h&gt;'       -i lib/saslutil.c &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed '/plugin_common/a #include &lt;time.h&gt;' -i plugins/cram.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Cyrus SASL</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Cyrus SASL</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                       \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc                   \\\n"
"            --enable-auth-sasldb                \\\n"
"            --with-dblib=lmdb                   \\\n"
"            --with-dbpath=/var/lib/sasl/sasldb2 \\\n"
"            --with-sphinx-build=no              \\\n"
"            --with-saslauthd=/var/run/saslauthd &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -j1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                       \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc                   \\\n"
"            --enable-auth-sasldb                \\\n"
"            --with-dblib=lmdb                   \\\n"
"            --with-dbpath=/var/lib/sasl/sasldb2 \\\n"
"            --with-sphinx-build=no              \\\n"
"            --with-saslauthd=/var/run/saslauthd &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -j1</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package does not come with a test suite. If you are planning on using "
"the GSSAPI authentication mechanism, test it after installing the package "
"using the sample server and client programs which were built in the "
"preceding step. Instructions for performing the tests can be found at <ulink"
" url=\"&hints-root;/downloads/files/cyrus-sasl.txt\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste. Se estiver planejando usar o "
"mecanismo de autenticação GSSAPI, [então teste-o depois de instalar o pacote"
" usando os aplicativos de amostra servidor e cliente que foram construídos "
"na etapa anterior. As instruções para realizar os testes podem ser "
"encontradas em <ulink url=\"&hints-root;/downloads/files/cyrus-sasl.txt\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755                          /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644  saslauthd/LDAP_SASLAUTHD /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;      &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644  doc/legacy/*.html        /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm700 /var/lib/sasl</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755                         /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644  saslauthd/LDAP_SASLAUTHD /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;      &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644  doc/legacy/*.html        /usr/share/doc/cyrus-sasl-&cyrus-sasl-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm700 /var/lib/sasl</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-dbpath=/var/lib/sasl/sasldb2</parameter>: This switch "
"forces the <command>sasldb</command> database to be created in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/lib/sasl</filename> instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-dbpath=/var/lib/sasl/sasldb2</parameter>: Essa chave força"
" a base de dados <command>sasldb</command> a ser criada em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/ lib/sasl</filename> em vez de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-saslauthd=/var/run/saslauthd</parameter>: This switch "
"forces <command>saslauthd</command> to use the FHS compliant directory "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/var/run/saslauthd</filename> for variable "
"run-time data."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-saslauthd=/var/run/saslauthd</parameter>: Essa chave força"
" <command>saslauthd</command> a usar o diretório conforme com FHS <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run/ saslauthd</filename> para dados variáveis de "
"tempo de execução."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-auth-sasldb</parameter>: This switch enables the SASLDB "
"authentication backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-auth-sasldb</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a estrutura"
" de retaguarda de autenticação SASLDB."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-dblib=gdbm</option>: This switch forces "
"<application>GDBM</application> to be used instead of "
"<application>LMDB</application>. Use this if you have not installed "
"<application>LMDB</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-dblib=gdbm</option>: Essa chave força "
"<application>GDBM</application> a ser usado em vez de "
"<application>LMDB</application>. Use isso se você não tiver instalado "
"<application>LMDB</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-ldap</option>: This switch enables LDAP support through "
"<application>OpenLDAP</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-ldap</option>: Essa chave habilita suporte LDAP por meio do "
"<application>OpenLDAP</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-ldapdb</option>: This switch enables the LDAPDB "
"authentication backend."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-ldapdb</option>: Essa chave habilita a estrutura de "
"retaguarda de autenticação LDAPDB."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-login</option>: This option enables the unsupported LOGIN "
"authentication method. Do not use it unless you have a specific reason to do"
" so as it is insecure by nature."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-login</option>: Essa opção habilita o método de "
"autenticação não suportado LOGIN. Não o use, a menos que você tenha um "
"motivo específico para fazer isso, pois ele é inseguro por natureza."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:214
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-ntlm</option>: This option enables the unsupported NTLM "
"authentication method. Do not use it unless you have a specific reason to do"
" so as it is insecure by nature, and the protocol has been phased out from "
"the latest versions of Windows."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-ntlm</option>: Essa opção habilita o método de autenticação"
" não suportado NTLM. Não o use, a menos que você tenha um motivo específico "
"para fazê-lo, pois ele é inseguro por natureza e o protocolo foi "
"descontinuado nas versões mais recentes do Windows."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ...</command>: These commands install additional "
"documentation which is not installed by the <command>make install</command> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ...</command>: Esses comandos instalam "
"documentação adicional que não é instalada pelo comando <command>make "
"install</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cyrus-sasl.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m700 -d /var/lib/sasl</command>: This directory must "
"exist when starting <command>saslauthd</command> or using the sasldb plugin."
" If you're not going to be running the daemon or using the plugins, you may "
"omit the creation of this directory."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m700 -d /var/lib/sasl</command>: Esse diretório precisa"
" existir ao iniciar <command>saslauthd</command> ou usar o plug-in sasldb. "
"Se não vai executar o processo de segundo plano ou usar os plugins, [então] "
"você pode omitir a criação desse diretório."

